    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Opening hours",
     "texto": [
      "**Program** can mean «timetable» or «programme», depending on the context. At a service, **programul** usually shows the opening hours. **Muzeului** means «of the museum»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Signs",
     "texto": [
      "**Intrare** is «entrance» and **ieșire**, «exit». **Acces interzis** means «no admittance»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
